WEBVTT

00:25.600 --> 00:28.280
In a country where
there's no place for the poor,

00:33.480 --> 00:35.880
and no consequences for the rich,

00:40.120 --> 00:45.720
maybe, the verdict isn't from the court,

00:50.000 --> 00:52.800
but instead,
it's up to the amount of money you've got.

02:27.320 --> 02:30.280
I think we can't continue

02:31.120 --> 02:32.560
if you don't speak the truth.

02:32.640 --> 02:35.120
No matter how many times I speak,
I'll say the same thing.

02:35.200 --> 02:36.680
I didn't cheat on the exam.

02:37.160 --> 02:38.520
Only you, the headmaster, blame me.

02:38.600 --> 02:42.160
It's just as you see. That's why
I had to invite you here, Mr. Songkiat.

02:42.240 --> 02:44.040
But you don't have any proof.

02:44.120 --> 02:46.680
Then why don't you
just force me to confess?

02:47.520 --> 02:49.240
You didn't have to call my dad
for this mess.

02:54.720 --> 02:56.120
Apologize to the headmaster now.

02:57.080 --> 02:57.960
Dad!

02:58.040 --> 02:58.880
Minnie.

03:02.240 --> 03:03.120
I'm sorry.

03:06.440 --> 03:09.720
Look at her and speak nicely.

03:15.440 --> 03:17.840
I'm sorry, Madam Headmaster.

03:25.240 --> 03:29.080
But about cheating on the exam,
that's a serious matter for our school.

03:29.160 --> 03:31.920
Yes, I'd like to donate
1,000,000 baht to the school,

03:32.000 --> 03:34.560
for my daughter's bad behavior this time.

03:38.200 --> 03:41.120
However, Minnie will be punished.

03:43.200 --> 03:44.240
I understand that.

03:46.000 --> 03:50.280
Would you like me
to write a check in your name?

03:56.840 --> 03:57.720
You…

03:58.200 --> 04:01.920
will have to clean the restroom
in Building 4 for the whole semester.

04:02.000 --> 04:03.200
Understood, Minnie?

04:08.600 --> 04:09.600
Yes, ma'am.

04:11.520 --> 04:12.640
Why did you hit me?

04:12.720 --> 04:14.840
If I didn't, you would've been expelled.

04:14.920 --> 04:16.160
That's fine. I don't care.

04:16.240 --> 04:18.760
But I do. I'm sick and tired
of finding you schools to study.

04:18.840 --> 04:20.840
-Someone must have told the teacher.
-Hey!

04:20.920 --> 04:22.600
Will you stop babbling?

04:22.680 --> 04:24.600
You want to embarrass me more?

04:25.760 --> 04:27.640
Well… but…

04:27.720 --> 04:30.160
the headmaster has no proof,
so how could she punish me?

04:30.240 --> 04:33.800
You're stupid. You copied every answer.

04:34.400 --> 04:35.640
How could she not know?

04:35.720 --> 04:38.520
And why can't other people think
that I might be the one who got copied?

04:41.120 --> 04:45.520
I'm not the headmaster.
You don't have to lie to me.

04:47.040 --> 04:49.680
I know well enough that you…

04:49.760 --> 04:53.440
you never admit your wrongdoings.

04:57.560 --> 04:58.880
Be more clever.

05:03.760 --> 05:07.720
I'll take your car,
and you'll be grounded for a month.

05:07.800 --> 05:10.680
You can't leave the house
after 6 p.m., period.

05:10.760 --> 05:13.080
Are you out of your mind?
You can't do this.

05:13.160 --> 05:17.560
I just lost 1,000,000 baht,
so you wouldn't be expelled.

05:17.640 --> 05:19.160
-But--
-But what?

05:31.400 --> 05:34.000
Hey there, Minnie!

05:34.080 --> 05:36.440
Je, I'm coming to pick you up.

05:36.520 --> 05:39.000
To where? Are you driving now?

05:40.080 --> 05:41.160
Yes.

05:41.240 --> 05:44.200
Oh, and what about
your dad's 6 p.m. curfew?

05:44.280 --> 05:45.480
Let him do it himself.

05:45.560 --> 05:48.560
There's no fucking proof.
How could I be punished?

05:50.440 --> 05:51.520
Oh, right!

05:52.480 --> 05:55.200
Or… was it actually Ploen?

05:55.280 --> 05:57.720
She let me copy her exam
and then told the teacher.

05:57.800 --> 05:59.200
Why would she do that?

05:59.280 --> 06:01.960
Or she doesn't like
the fact that you're richer?

06:03.680 --> 06:06.360
When you paid,
did you use internet banking?

06:06.440 --> 06:08.360
That could be evidence.

06:10.080 --> 06:12.440
No. I paid in cash.

06:14.640 --> 06:18.080
But that's true. If there's no proof,
how could the headmaster punish you?

06:18.160 --> 06:19.480
That's not right.

06:24.360 --> 06:25.200
No.

06:25.800 --> 06:29.240
That's why we need to break
Mr. Songkiat's curfew

06:29.320 --> 06:31.960
and celebrate till dawn, okay?

06:32.680 --> 06:34.600
All right. I'll come along.

06:34.680 --> 06:35.760
That's my girl!

06:35.840 --> 06:39.520
I'm about to pass by the school.
Be there in a sec. See you soon, girl.

06:39.600 --> 06:41.040
Okay. See you.

06:42.160 --> 06:43.920
Bye-bye, Miss Minnie.

07:44.920 --> 07:45.880
Nanno.

08:04.640 --> 08:05.600
Ploen.

08:10.800 --> 08:13.760
Minnie. Help me.

08:28.040 --> 08:30.200
Or… was it actually Ploen?

08:30.280 --> 08:32.240
She let me copy her exam
and then told the teacher.

08:45.080 --> 08:47.120
Why don't you help your friend, Minnie?

08:57.880 --> 08:58.720
Ploen.

09:38.040 --> 09:39.840
Dad. Help me.

09:40.520 --> 09:45.400
This just came in.
There has been an accident,

09:45.480 --> 09:49.120
a car crashed into a school pick-up.

09:49.200 --> 09:50.160
There are students…

09:50.240 --> 09:53.560
These are the names
of the four students killed.

09:53.640 --> 09:55.880
They are all 17 to 18 years old,

09:55.960 --> 09:59.720
and it is speculated
they're the schoolmates of the suspect.

09:59.800 --> 10:01.760
We'll have an interview with her dad.

10:01.840 --> 10:04.880
Hey, mister… are you Minnie's dad?

10:04.960 --> 10:06.240
A little interview, please.

10:06.320 --> 10:08.120
 So what do you have to say
about the accident?

10:08.800 --> 10:12.640
Excuse me. My daughter is still in shock.

10:13.120 --> 10:16.360
Right now,
we're not ready for an interview.

10:16.440 --> 10:19.200
She's shocked because she was intoxicated?

10:20.000 --> 10:21.800
There's no alcohol involved.

10:23.080 --> 10:24.600
-No.
-You said there's no alcohol.

10:24.680 --> 10:26.040
Have the police tested that?

10:26.800 --> 10:29.880
I told you there's none.
And we're not ready for an interview.

10:29.960 --> 10:32.760
It's still the news
that we're following right now.

10:32.840 --> 10:35.480
I believe that a lot of people
want to hear more about this.

10:35.560 --> 10:36.960
How will it turn out? We'll…

10:43.000 --> 10:45.920
See? See what you've done?

10:48.520 --> 10:52.120
I told you not to leave the house.
Why did you leave?

10:55.160 --> 10:57.960
I didn't mean
for all this to happen, really.

10:58.640 --> 10:59.480
But…

11:00.680 --> 11:02.680
suddenly, the brakes didn't work.

11:02.760 --> 11:05.680
Here we go again.
Are you denying it again?

11:08.920 --> 11:12.280
I'm not lying, Dad.
The brakes weren't really working.

11:15.000 --> 11:18.000
She said that the brakes weren't working.
Why don't you just believe her?

11:20.280 --> 11:21.400
The brakes weren't working?

11:22.800 --> 11:27.600
You know,
if I hadn't taken out the wine bottle,

11:29.560 --> 11:31.160
she would've ended up in jail right now.

11:32.200 --> 11:33.280
Really, dear?

11:33.920 --> 11:36.920
But the brakes really weren't working.

11:39.000 --> 11:41.280
Dad, do you really think
I wanted to hit someone?

11:41.840 --> 11:45.040
That's right, honey.
Let's find a way to help her.

11:46.360 --> 11:50.080
You… How many times
do you want me to clean up your mess?

11:53.360 --> 11:54.960
Dad, you have to help me.

11:58.600 --> 12:02.560
If you're charged with a crime,
the company's stocks will completely drop.

12:03.600 --> 12:06.680
This time, you just shut your mouth…

12:09.080 --> 12:11.360
and do everything as I say.

12:15.760 --> 12:16.960
Understood?

12:24.520 --> 12:25.880
Here she comes.

12:26.440 --> 12:28.200
How dare she still come to school?

12:28.280 --> 12:30.000
I bet she was drunk last night.

12:30.560 --> 12:32.320
How can she act like nothing happened?

13:15.120 --> 13:16.080
Je…

13:20.800 --> 13:21.880
Minnie.

13:32.960 --> 13:37.320
It happened because of
a brake malfunction.

13:37.400 --> 13:40.840
Minnie wasn't drunk-driving.

13:41.520 --> 13:45.760
And the reason I'm saying this is because…

13:47.080 --> 13:49.880
Minnie has never touched
any alcoholic drinks.

13:49.960 --> 13:52.080
-Bullshit.
-Bullshit.

13:52.160 --> 13:55.200
Is he for real? That's a shameless lie.
She's never touched alcohol?

13:55.280 --> 13:56.760
I've seen her drink before.

13:57.240 --> 13:59.080
She was so drunk, she threw up
at the new year's party, remember?

13:59.160 --> 14:00.600
Everybody in school saw that.

14:00.680 --> 14:03.040
But I think she'll get away with it,
you believe me?

14:03.120 --> 14:05.720
Well, her dad is that rich…

14:05.800 --> 14:09.280
Give Minnie an opportunity
to prove herself this time.

14:11.000 --> 14:13.360
MINNIE. TO HELL WITH MINNIE,
THAT QUADRUPLE MURDERER.

14:13.440 --> 14:16.080
SHE KILLED FOUR PEOPLE AND STILL GOT AWAY.

14:20.520 --> 14:24.400
EACH OF US STABS HER, AND SHE'S A GONER.
SHE SHOULD DIE FOUR TIMES.

14:31.160 --> 14:32.400
Ploen was a good girl.

14:32.480 --> 14:33.760
PARENTS OF PLOEN, ONE OF THE FOUR VICTIMS.

14:33.840 --> 14:36.680
When she got home,
she helped me with chores.

14:36.760 --> 14:38.280
Helped me with selling stuff.

14:39.440 --> 14:41.440
We put our hopes on her.

14:41.520 --> 14:43.840
I'd like the court to be just,

14:44.680 --> 14:46.280
and not side with what's wrong.

14:47.400 --> 14:50.880
And has Minnie, the suspect,
come to apologize to you two?

14:51.480 --> 14:52.880
Never.

14:54.160 --> 14:57.840
And this is what
one of the deceased's families feels.

14:57.920 --> 15:00.920
We'll have to see how this case ends.

15:01.000 --> 15:04.360
Will it be similar to previous accidents

15:04.440 --> 15:07.360
caused by other famous families?

15:07.440 --> 15:08.440
That is unknown. Now…

15:13.320 --> 15:17.160
This is the testimony
drafted by the lawyer. Memorize it.

15:26.880 --> 15:29.040
"The pick-up driver parked unsafely"?

15:30.160 --> 15:32.520
Do as I say. Don't ask.

15:37.480 --> 15:39.040
You know I'm not a good liar.

15:43.040 --> 15:44.280
Not a good liar?

15:45.600 --> 15:48.640
You cheated on a test,
yet you denied everything.

15:51.200 --> 15:54.600
But it's not the same. I can't do it.

15:56.640 --> 15:57.920
All these times,

15:58.960 --> 16:03.120
the whole family has been frowned upon,
I'm embarrassed enough already.

16:05.240 --> 16:07.320
Do you want me to have more of this?

16:09.600 --> 16:10.520
And you want more?

16:16.680 --> 16:21.120
THE DEFENDANT CLAIMS THAT SHE WAS
DRIVING WITHIN THE LEGAL SPEED LIMIT.

16:21.200 --> 16:23.920
THE DEFENDANT WAS CAREFUL
AS A PERSON OF ORDINARY PRUDENCE.

16:27.400 --> 16:29.480
GIVEN THAT THE AREA WAS DARK,
THE VICTIMS WERE ALSO RESPONSIBLE…

16:32.480 --> 16:34.720
CONSIDERING THE SCENE, IT WAS CAUSED
BY THE RECKLESS ACTIONS OF THE VICTIMS.

16:57.320 --> 16:59.920
How did you feel after the first hearing?

17:00.920 --> 17:03.120
Excuse me, ma'am.
She can't give an interview right now,

17:03.200 --> 17:04.360
as it can jeopardize the case.

17:14.680 --> 17:18.079
Was it from this bottle
that you drank that night?

17:23.920 --> 17:27.560
So, did you have
any alcoholic drinks that night?

17:29.880 --> 17:31.319
-So, did you drink?
-Did you?

17:31.400 --> 17:33.880
Please answer the question.

17:33.960 --> 17:37.800
Can you answer the question?

17:37.880 --> 17:41.840
Please give us an answer.

18:19.400 --> 18:23.600
WHO WANTS TO SEE #MINNIE4BODIES
PAY FOR HER CRIME, RAISE YOUR HAND!

18:26.480 --> 18:31.920
LET'S VOTE FOR LESSONS
TO TEACH #MINNIE4BODIES.

18:35.040 --> 18:36.920
CUT HER FACE. #MINNIE4BODIES

18:37.000 --> 18:38.600
I'LL KNOCK HER TEETH OUT.
#MINNIE4BODIES

18:38.680 --> 18:41.800
IF I HAD A BRAT LIKE #MINNIE4BODIES,
I'D CHOKE HER TO DEATH.

18:45.600 --> 18:48.640
KILL AND BUTCHER HER #MINNIE4BODIES

19:49.240 --> 19:52.320
Je. Why are you avoiding me?

19:53.160 --> 19:54.760
I'm not.

19:54.840 --> 19:56.080
Don't say you're not.

19:56.160 --> 19:57.800
Even if the others hate me, fuck it.

19:58.480 --> 20:00.560
But that night, you talked to me.

20:01.160 --> 20:02.200
But…

20:02.840 --> 20:04.440
But what? Just say it.

20:05.000 --> 20:07.880
I told you the brakes
weren't really working.

20:08.880 --> 20:10.760
You don't believe me?

20:12.680 --> 20:15.200
Je. You must believe me.

20:17.280 --> 20:21.320
Yes. I believe you. But…

20:22.400 --> 20:24.320
-I…
-But… what?

20:27.920 --> 20:29.600
What is it? Tell me.

20:30.560 --> 20:32.280
-I just…
-Yes?

20:33.640 --> 20:38.560
…see those four people
behind you all the time.

22:34.400 --> 22:35.400
Nanno.

22:59.840 --> 23:00.840
Where are they?

23:02.680 --> 23:04.640
Aren’t you just so impatient
like your daughter?

23:25.480 --> 23:28.440
Are you sure there aren’t any more copies?

23:33.360 --> 23:36.720
I don't know where you got these photos

23:38.040 --> 23:40.080
because I gave orders to the police
to delete them.

23:45.680 --> 23:47.960
I'll give you money, just this one time.

23:50.440 --> 23:52.520
If these pics appear again,

23:54.520 --> 23:56.760
I can't guarantee your safety.

24:34.560 --> 24:37.960
Back to the news
which is the talk of the town,

24:38.040 --> 24:39.960
the "4-Death Minnie" case.

24:40.040 --> 24:42.080
There has been criticism

24:42.160 --> 24:43.880
as to the transparency of this case.

24:45.760 --> 24:50.280
If you get away with it,
I’ll kill you with my own hands.

24:58.440 --> 25:01.080
-Why don't you help your friend, Minnie?
-Help.

25:37.400 --> 25:39.040
I see those four girls

25:40.720 --> 25:42.760
following me all the time.

25:46.200 --> 25:47.800
I can't take it anymore, Mom.

25:51.000 --> 25:52.480
Calm down, dear.

25:54.440 --> 25:56.240
You might be overthinking it.

25:58.200 --> 26:01.640
If you said the brakes weren't working,
then the brakes weren't working.

26:06.720 --> 26:08.120
It's not your fault.

26:08.880 --> 26:11.680
Others scold you so much
that you think it's your fault.

26:13.000 --> 26:17.200
The thing you need to worry about now
is us getting sued.

26:17.800 --> 26:20.520
Do as your dad says. Understood?

26:57.960 --> 27:01.560
Now, to the case
which has the public's attention.

27:01.640 --> 27:02.920
Today, at the youth court,

27:03.000 --> 27:06.160
the court will render a judgment
on the "4-Death Minnie" case.

27:06.760 --> 27:09.760
The incident was caused by
the recklessness of both parties.

27:09.840 --> 27:13.640
The pick-up was parked at a dangerous spot

27:13.720 --> 27:15.920
which was prone to accidents.

27:16.000 --> 27:21.280
The court has ordered Minnie to pay
damages to the deceased's families

27:21.360 --> 27:23.680
amounting to 300,000 baht each,

27:23.760 --> 27:28.120
and engage in
a 300-hour community service.

28:00.480 --> 28:03.480
Don't be afraid, Minnie. Don't be.

28:14.240 --> 28:15.680
You're guilty.

28:17.240 --> 28:18.960
Die. You killed other people.

28:19.040 --> 28:20.360
You're guilty.

28:20.440 --> 28:22.120
-You made them die.
-I'm not guilty.

28:22.200 --> 28:23.880
-You're guilty.
-I'm not guilty.

28:23.960 --> 28:27.200
-I'm not guilty.
-What's the matter, Minnie?

28:30.200 --> 28:31.480
What's wrong?

28:33.640 --> 28:37.760
Hey, sir. The brakes won't work!

29:31.640 --> 29:33.480
Welcome to

29:33.560 --> 29:38.120
Who Wants Minnie to Pay for Her Crime,
Raise Your Hand Show!

29:39.800 --> 29:43.320
Minnie, do you know that
many people want to see you?

29:43.400 --> 29:45.400
You're more famous than a celebrity!

29:47.440 --> 29:49.480
Come on out!

29:56.760 --> 29:57.960
Who are you?

30:00.200 --> 30:03.320
Just ordinary people
who want to see you get punished.

30:04.120 --> 30:07.440
Minnie, do you know
how many people like this are out there?

30:08.840 --> 30:12.280
Come on! Are you ready
to hear the audience's judgment?

30:13.920 --> 30:15.560
For the 4th prize,

30:15.640 --> 30:17.240
"I want to see Minnie's legs broken,

30:17.320 --> 30:19.440
because the legs
that didn't hit the brakes

30:19.520 --> 30:21.000
are the cause of this whole tragedy."

30:23.200 --> 30:24.840
Go on!

30:55.080 --> 30:57.560
Let's continue. For the 3rd prize,

30:58.640 --> 31:00.800
"I want to slap her
until all her teeth fall off and die

31:00.880 --> 31:02.240
for her shameless bullshitting!"

31:02.320 --> 31:04.840
Bullshitting? Well, that's true!

31:14.320 --> 31:17.320
You've been slapped for quite some time,
but your teeth haven't fallen off yet.

31:17.960 --> 31:19.640
Should you guys change the way to do it?

31:48.120 --> 31:49.960
Your teeth are out…

31:51.880 --> 31:53.400
but you're not dead yet.

31:54.000 --> 31:56.960
If you're not dead,
then we can't go on to the next prize.

32:35.080 --> 32:36.640
Why are you so surprised, Minnie?

32:37.160 --> 32:38.600
The 2nd prize is just coming.

32:38.680 --> 32:41.880
The owner of this prize is
Ploen's dad and mom.

32:43.600 --> 32:45.320
Welcome!

32:55.400 --> 32:59.320
You're guilty,
but you're not admitting it, are you?

33:01.200 --> 33:03.360
I'm not guilty.
The brakes weren't really working.

33:07.120 --> 33:09.160
I'm not guilty.

33:12.200 --> 33:14.400
I'm not guilty!

33:18.440 --> 33:20.840
I'm not guilty!

33:25.000 --> 33:27.240
I'm not guilty!

34:16.800 --> 34:20.520
Dad, there are people out there
wanting to kill us. We have to run.

34:21.080 --> 34:22.760
Don't be afraid, Minnie.

34:23.239 --> 34:24.239
It's all taken care of.

34:25.040 --> 34:26.320
No one is going to kill us.

34:32.159 --> 34:33.239
Really, Dad?

34:34.600 --> 34:38.360
Of course. Don't be afraid.

34:39.920 --> 34:41.840
Don't be afraid.

34:44.880 --> 34:46.719
No one can hurt you.

34:57.120 --> 34:58.960
Dad.

35:00.080 --> 35:02.680
Dad, I can't breathe. Dad!

35:02.760 --> 35:05.360
Dad, let go. Dad!

35:15.600 --> 35:17.280
Didn't you realize it by now?

35:17.840 --> 35:21.160
No one can hurt you,
except for your own dad.

35:22.320 --> 35:25.440
Let's go on. The first prize is…

35:25.520 --> 35:29.640
"I want to choke you to death, you brat,
for causing me trouble every day."

35:30.440 --> 35:34.640
That's from Mr. Songkiat,
and he is Minnie's dad!

35:35.520 --> 35:38.320
Dad, let go. Dad!

35:43.640 --> 35:45.440
Dad.

36:05.200 --> 36:08.880
Don't be afraid, Minnie.
This will hurt just a bit.

36:13.360 --> 36:15.800
Dad.

37:22.880 --> 37:24.560
How are you doing, Minnie?

37:30.000 --> 37:32.280
If you had admitted what you did,

37:33.360 --> 37:35.120
you wouldn't be in this condition.

37:39.960 --> 37:42.400
But Minnie,
you've been dead just three times.

37:48.760 --> 37:50.320
Aren't you tired yet?

37:57.360 --> 37:58.920
Get some rest.

38:37.680 --> 38:40.320
Wow, there's a TV.

38:42.040 --> 38:42.920
That's nice.

38:51.480 --> 38:55.600
And now, we have important evidence

38:55.680 --> 38:58.840
that could potentially make the police

38:58.920 --> 39:01.960
reopen the "4-Death Minnie" case.

39:02.040 --> 39:05.440
It's this photo
that was sent to our reporter.

39:05.520 --> 39:07.160
And we're seeing it now.

39:13.800 --> 39:15.800
IMPORTANT EVIDENCE FOUND,
"4-DEATH MINNIE" CASE REOPENED

39:15.880 --> 39:19.120
In addition to the photo you see,
there's also an audio clip,

39:19.200 --> 39:22.560
which seems to be
the voice of Mr. Songkiat,

39:22.640 --> 39:24.480
Minnie's father.

39:24.560 --> 39:27.120
He's acting like
he's threatening the anonymous person

39:27.200 --> 39:30.120
to not publish this photo.

39:31.200 --> 39:33.760
I'll give you money, just this one time.

39:33.840 --> 39:36.040
If these pics appear again,

39:36.760 --> 39:38.680
I can't guarantee your safety.

39:41.080 --> 39:44.800
Right now, Mr. Songkiat…

39:46.160 --> 39:48.640
won't be able to help you anymore.

39:52.520 --> 39:54.720
The only way all this will end…

39:57.320 --> 39:58.280
is…

40:44.440 --> 40:45.880
The weather's so nice tonight.

41:38.520 --> 41:40.200
Here we meet again, Nanno.

41:44.800 --> 41:45.960
Hello, Yuri.

